WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:11.393 --> 00:00:14.500
- This right here is the L.A. dog.

00:00:14.500 --> 00:00:16.353
Also known as the street meat.

00:00:16.353 --> 00:00:19.759
- It's not the bacon or the
dog that makes this hot dog,

00:00:19.759 --> 00:00:23.196
It's the grilled onions,
the grilled jalapenos,

00:00:23.196 --> 00:00:25.737
a baking sheet, and some Sterno flames.

00:00:25.737 --> 00:00:28.158
It's disgusting, it's not to code,

00:00:28.158 --> 00:00:30.118
but this is (bleep) delicious.

00:00:30.118 --> 00:00:33.210
- In L.A. when it's 2 a.m. and you need

00:00:33.210 --> 00:00:36.810
to eat the tastiest thing,
in the fastest way possible.

00:00:36.810 --> 00:00:39.410
- After you've been
dancing all night long,

00:00:39.410 --> 00:00:41.130
usually when you put one
of these in your mouth,

00:00:41.130 --> 00:00:44.918
you're really sweaty, out of breath.

00:00:44.918 --> 00:00:46.772
- Oh my God, is this mayo on a hot dog?

00:00:46.772 --> 00:00:48.192
- They mayo is weird.
- No, it's not.

00:00:48.192 --> 00:00:50.353
- You barely get any dog

00:00:50.353 --> 00:00:52.913
you're so distracted by the toppings.

00:00:52.913 --> 00:00:54.693
- There's so many different things here.

00:00:54.693 --> 00:00:57.611
Just like Los Angeles, the
melting pot of the world.

00:00:59.655 --> 00:01:02.378
- A Chicago dog has poppy seed bun,

00:01:02.378 --> 00:01:03.955
big ol' Vienna sausage,

00:01:03.955 --> 00:01:06.936
got your green relish, hot
peppers, tomato, onions.

00:01:06.936 --> 00:01:08.538
- Mustard, no ketchup.

00:01:08.538 --> 00:01:10.389
Ketchup is a bullshit
condiment, in my opinion.

00:01:10.389 --> 00:01:11.737
- Why does this look like that?

00:01:11.737 --> 00:01:13.537
- That's relish.
- It's neon.

00:01:13.537 --> 00:01:15.055
- Kinda feel like I should
have like one of those

00:01:15.055 --> 00:01:16.838
glow stick tongue thing.

00:01:16.838 --> 00:01:19.117
- Who goes to a hot dog place and says,

00:01:19.117 --> 00:01:21.299
"Let me get a whole slab of pickle on it"?

00:01:21.299 --> 00:01:23.530
- (laughing) Yeah, it's
like two or three pickles...

00:01:23.530 --> 00:01:25.471
- Because pickles are good.

00:01:25.471 --> 00:01:29.211
- You could wrap the hot
dog itself in this pickle.

00:01:29.211 --> 00:01:30.771
- Oh yeah, that's a good dog.

00:01:30.771 --> 00:01:33.271
- As the fat person here, I will say that

00:01:33.271 --> 00:01:35.291
I feel skinny in Chicago

00:01:35.291 --> 00:01:36.809
and this might be one of the reasons.

00:01:36.809 --> 00:01:38.932
- I never say anything
bad about Chicago people

00:01:38.932 --> 00:01:42.605
because it's so sweet that
they think they have a city.

00:01:42.605 --> 00:01:43.751
- Oh!

00:01:43.751 --> 00:01:45.733
- If you ever ask for ketchup
on a hot dog in Chicago

00:01:45.733 --> 00:01:47.126
you will not get served a hot dog.

00:01:47.126 --> 00:01:48.422
- What's this?

00:01:48.422 --> 00:01:51.014
- It's ketchup before,
it's like after, no,

00:01:51.014 --> 00:01:52.459
- It's the same thing.
- It's before.

00:01:54.596 --> 00:01:57.189
- Guys, this is a New York hot dog.

00:01:57.189 --> 00:01:58.688
- The dirty-water dog.

00:01:58.688 --> 00:02:02.688
- It's got mustard, it's
got some sweet onions,

00:02:02.688 --> 00:02:05.208
whatever you wanna do to your dog, you do.

00:02:05.208 --> 00:02:06.989
- Um, the onions go on the dog.

00:02:06.989 --> 00:02:08.385
I don't believe it.
- The smell is the gatekeeper

00:02:08.385 --> 00:02:09.709
to what goes in my mouth.

00:02:09.709 --> 00:02:12.984
- It's about capitalism and
like, democracy, this thing.

00:02:12.984 --> 00:02:14.402
- This is about minimalism.

00:02:14.402 --> 00:02:16.403
- It looks like New
York, how beat up it is.

00:02:16.403 --> 00:02:17.656
- Little shriveled.
- What doesn't kill you

00:02:17.656 --> 00:02:19.620
makes you strong-ah.

00:02:19.620 --> 00:02:20.710
- This looks like something you'd find

00:02:20.710 --> 00:02:22.550
at the bottom of your purse
at the end of the night.

00:02:22.550 --> 00:02:24.591
And if you were drunk
enough, you would eat it.

00:02:24.591 --> 00:02:27.319
- New York doesn't need
to sound appealing to L.A.

00:02:28.819 --> 00:02:30.096
- L.A. dog for the win.

00:02:30.096 --> 00:02:30.913
- L.A. dog.

00:02:30.913 --> 00:02:31.816
- The L.A. dog.

00:02:31.816 --> 00:02:33.288
- L.A. is the clear winner.

00:02:33.288 --> 00:02:34.025
- Chicago.

00:02:34.025 --> 00:02:34.805
- Chicago dog.

00:02:34.805 --> 00:02:36.704
- Who doesn't like neon things?

00:02:36.704 --> 00:02:38.224
- I wanna apologize to my family,

00:02:38.224 --> 00:02:40.545
to my uncles, to my grandmothers.

00:02:40.545 --> 00:02:44.246
This L.A. dog, it's beats
the Chicago dog for me.

00:02:44.246 --> 00:02:45.093
- The L.A. won.

00:02:45.093 --> 00:02:46.253
- New York dog all the way.

00:02:46.253 --> 00:02:47.215
- The L.A. dog.

00:02:47.215 --> 00:02:50.069
- New York hot dog, that's it.
- What?

00:02:50.069 --> 00:02:51.906
- That's it.
- Is what?

00:02:51.906 --> 00:02:52.934
Is not the winner.
- That's all you need.

00:02:52.934 --> 00:02:54.294
That is all you need for New York.

00:02:54.294 --> 00:02:55.371
- You know what the best
part about New York?

00:02:55.371 --> 00:02:56.926
We don't even talk about you other cities.

00:02:56.926 --> 00:02:58.648
We don't even talk about it.

00:02:58.648 --> 00:03:00.909
I don't even know where you guys are from.

00:03:00.909 --> 00:03:02.233
It doesn't matter to me.

00:03:05.189 --> 00:03:06.509
- I wish there was ketchup.
- Are you kidding me?

00:03:06.509 --> 00:03:07.829
- It would be so much, there is ketchup.

00:03:07.829 --> 00:03:09.669
- There's no ketchup allowed.

00:03:09.669 --> 00:03:12.030
I am not gonna let you use this.

